90
00:04:28.716 --> 00:04:31.596
You will discuss this, I think, in detail tomorrow,

91
00:04:31.636 --> 00:04:34.106
it is the entire layer of this retina with the

92
00:04:34.146 --> 00:04:36.396
pigmentary layer, and then what are called the

93
00:04:36.436 --> 00:04:39.276
photoreceptors, which are of the type that you...

94
00:04:40.707 --> 00:04:42.407
know as cones and rods.

95
00:04:42.447 --> 00:04:45.747
But you also have a layer called the ganglion cells.

96
00:04:45.787 --> 00:04:47.977
It is truly an important layer for

97
00:04:52.187 --> 00:04:54.887
